	ll also available in person Monday through Friday from Noon to 6 p.m. at t
	he TUTS Box Office\, located in the Hobby Center lobby. \nDiscounted group
	 tickets are available for parties of 10 or more.Theatre Under The Stars h
	as a variety of accessibility options for guests.Learn more about accessib
